{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: Unhkl Flex]\n[00:11.90] Oh-oh\n[00:12.00] (Joey, you want one?)\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:13.18] I hope you understand, when you call my phone\n[00:15.80] Hear the ringtone, leave a message at the tone\n[00:18.44] I was movin' bales, baby leave me alone\n[00:21.64] I was movin' bales, baby leave me alone\n[00:24.28] Why you gotta call my phone, no I'm not at home\n[00:27.90] Baby let me roam, money on my phone\n[00:30.64] Take you shoppin' up in Rome, just to put you in your place, huh\n[00:34.38] I don't wanna hear shit when I'm out of state, huh\n[00:37.44] They was talking down to me, but that's A-Okay, huh\n[00:40.62] My new AK, just like man down, mayday, huh\n[00:43.90] Run in your house, whеre the safe, huh\n[00:45.40] Nobody in hеre is safe, huh\n[00:46.98] Hands in the air, I can see him, a stick on lil' nigga what's up in your place huh, place huh\n[Chorus: Unhkl Flex]\n[00:52.86] She gon' move her ass, just like I move the bale\n[01:00.86] She gon' move her ass, just like I move the bale\n[01:03.42] She gon' move her ass, just like I move the bale\n[01:04.74] She gon' move her ass, just like I move the bale\n[Verse 2: Unhkl Flex]\n[01:06.28] I'm moving a quart with a hundred-thousand-dollar chain on\n[01:07.74] I got an AMG, probably three years on the front, the courthouse look like Chicco\n[01:09.84] And my baby mama thought she'd leave the AMG and gon' jump me in Range Rover\n[01:12.92] I get the fuck up outta Indiana then I go meet up with my main girl\n[01:16.08] I was saved by the bell, the way that I'm moving saving me from jail\n[01:19.20] You ain't got no clientele, my nigga, then you ain't gotta hit my cell\n[01:22.44] I got a Glock with a scope and a beam and extension, fuck around and probably evoke\n[01:25.56] Kill everybody, tryna take my gold, Illuminati, shawty, prolly take his soul\n[Verse 3: Juice WRLD]\n[01:28.78] I kick this shit like this shit is karate, I take a Xanny and die with a Molly, uh\n[01:32.30] I just got drunk on the party, that bitch so fake that I call her a Barbie, uh\n[01:35.52] Run up on me, then I'm shooting, yo' girl gon' ride me, like my shit a Harley, ooh (Pew-pew, pew)\n[01:38.62] Do I love her? Hardly, I was smokin' on that Marley, ooh\n[01:41.80] You know I can't keep up, but they need us\n[01:45.54] My brother movin' bales like Adidas\n[01:48.14] Yeah, he got his stripes up, we some hoopers, uh\n[01:51.28] Shorty wanna kick it, I told her this isn't FIFA\n[01:54.92] You can catch me rollin' reefer, huh\n[01:57.26] Rollin' papers like my last name Khalifa, huh, ayy\n[02:00.96] I be movin' faster than a cheetah\n[02:03.40] Expose hoes, yeah, you know that bitch a cheater, hey\n[02:08.12] I was in the trap, I was movin' bales\n[02:10.82] Wit' a broke heart, baby, can you fucking tell? Huh, ayy\n[02:14.48] I won't kiss and tell, send it through the mail, huh\n[02:17.18] My love letter in a song, send it through the mail\n[Bridge: Unhkl Flex]\n[02:19.94] She gon' move her ass just like I move— (Oh-oh)\n[02:30.60] She gon' move her ass just like I move— (Just like I move)\n[Verse 4: Juice WRLD]\n[02:34.52] Ayy, move them bales, I don't trust them niggas\n[02:36.22] Niggas tattletale, ayy, I can tell\n[02:39.78] Pull up on the scene, my .40 on my belt\n[02:43.10] I been ballin' out, I feel like Raymond Felton\n[02:46.28] I was movin' bales while you was in diapers\n[02:49.48] I was movin' bales, yeah, I was sellin' hyper\n[02:52.50] Pull up in that Viper, drive it like a Spider\n[02:55.70] Fuckin' with the bales, that shit suicidal, ayy","words":[[1.4,3.94,"[Intro:"],[4.38,8.8,"Unhkl"],[11.74,11.84,"Flex]"],[11.9,11.96,"Oh-oh"],[12.0,12.16,"(Joey,"],[12.2,12.26,"you"],[12.32,12.46,"want"],[12.5,12.54,"one?)"],[12.58,12.7,"[Verse"],[12.72,12.74,"1:"],[12.8,13.0,"Juice"],[13.04,13.12,"WRLD]"],[13.18,13.18,"I"],[13.52,13.62,"hope"],[13.76,13.82,"you"],[13.86,14.24,"understand,"],[14.6,14.72,"when"],[15.16,15.22,"you"],[15.3,15.